# The headline property: a rename is not a change. `Gadget#store` renames the
# method, the parameter and the local, and still hashes to `Widget#save` —
# which is what makes the summary cache survive a refactor (DEC-003) and what
# makes the clone report about behaviour rather than spelling.
#
# The two controls matter as much as the collision. `Doodad#save` does one
# more thing; `Gizmo#save` does the same things with the locals swapped, so it
# reads the parameter where the original reads the local. Ordinals are
# positional precisely so that second one is caught.
dupes  Widget#save+Gadget#store
